-- coverage-recommendation Snippets placeholder ("[INSERT SNIPPET]" -- see
-- apps/web/src/lib/text-snippets.functions.ts), and an adjuster/insured
-- sign-off table. No merge tokens -- every field is hand-filled per claim.
